  {:id :print-vars-not-dynamic,
   :title "pr and *clojure-version* do not carry :dynamic metadata",
   :category-id :metadata,
   :rationale
   "On the JVM these two are marked dynamic for\n                    host-historical reasons (pprint-era rebinding and\n                    a version map nobody rebinds). mino does not\n                    inherit the wart; neither var is rebindable and\n                    neither claims to be.",
